ctions ( Not A Dating Event )","url":"https://www.meetup.com/stop-scrolling-start-meeting-people/events/315188796/","description":"### 🎟️ Registration Required\n\nTo attend, please create your free account and register through - https://famelee.ai/signup\n**Limited spots available. Come solo, leave with new friends, memories, and your new social circle.**\nWe Need atleast 50 registeration to run this, Please register and we will email you once we get 50 people.\nLocation will be emailed separately who signed up\n\nUpdate - We are trying to find out the right venue as we have more then 50 people to accommodate\n\nTired of small talk and endless scrolling? Join us for an evening designed to help you build genuine friendships that feel like family.\nWhether you're new to the city, looking to expand your social circle, or simply want to meet amazing people, this event is all about fun, connection, and creating lasting memories.\nNo networking. No awkward speeches. Just real people, exciting games, great conversations, and a welcoming community.\n\n### 🎉 What to Expect\n\n✅ Icebreaker Challenges\nFun activities that make meeting new people easy and natural.\n✅ Flip the Cup Tournament\nTeam up, compete, and share plenty of laughs.\n✅ Speed Friending Sessions\nMeet multiple people in a relaxed and fun environment.\n✅ Human Bingo Challenge\nFind people with unique experiences and win prizes.\n✅ Team Building Games\nWork together, solve challenges, and create instant connections.\n✅ Mystery Partner Challenge\nGet paired with someone new and complete fun mini-missions.\n✅ Friendship Trivia Battle\nTest your knowledge and compete for bragging rights.\n✅ Group Social Mixer\nEnjoy music, snacks, and meaningful conversations.\n✅ \"Find Your Tribe\" Activity\nConnect with people who share your interests, hobbies, and lifestyle.\n\n### 🎁 Bonus\n\n* Meet people who are looking for genuine friendships.\n* Fun prizes and giveaways.\n* Photos and memories you'll want to keep.\n* Opportunity to join future community gatherings.\n\n### Who Should Attend?\n\n* Newcomers to the city\n* Professionals looking for a social life\n* Remote workers\n* Students and graduates\n* Anyone wanting to make real friends and meaningful connections\n\n### Our Mission\n\nWe believe friends can become family. This event is designed to bring together positive, welcoming people who want to build authentic relationships beyond social media.\n\n### 🎟️ Registration Required\n\nTo attend, please create your free account and register through https://famelee.ai/signup\n**Limited spots available. Come solo, leave with new friends, memories, and your new social circle.**","startDate":"2026-11-28T00:30:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-1-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"","addressRegion":"","addressCountry":""}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Stop Scrolling Start Meeting People","url":"https://www.meetup.com/stop-scrolling-start-meeting-people/"},"performer":"Stop Scrolling Start Meeting People"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Bon Echo Provincial Park camping","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-bonfires-meetup-group/events/316622813/","description":"**Bon Echo Provincial Park**","startDate":"2026-11-27T12:00:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-1-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"","addressRegion":"","addressCountry":""}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Move With Intention","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-bonfires-meetup-group/"},"performer":"Move With Intention"},{"@context":"https://schema.org"