days** — 9:15 to 10:45 PM\n\nPickup soccer runs weekly at **Crecent School**, **2365 Bayview Ave, North York ON M2L 1A2 (Bayview & Lawrence)**.\n\nGoogle Maps: https://share.google/WKVjgBaRJUrt2s0nI\n\nWe welcome skilled regulars and new players every week. There is always a game.\n\n**PROGRAM DETAILS**\n\n* **Format:** 7v7 - 3 Fields - 7 Teams Max\n* **Level:** All players welcome (Beginner to Advanced)\n* **Cost:** **$25/player** — *payment required in advance*\n* **Payment Email:** payments@soccertoronto.ca\n* **Register Online:** www.soccertoronto.ca\n\n**WHAT TO BRING**\n\n* Indoor turf shoes (no cleats)\n* Shin guards recommended\n* Water\n* Jerseys/pinnies/balls are provided\n\nMeet the organizer on the first field when you enter the facility.\n\n**REMINDER**\n\n**Meetup RSVP = NOT a confirmed spot.** Only website registrations count.\nSpace is limited — register early.","startDate":"2026-11-28T02:15:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-4-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Crescent School","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Toronto","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"2365 Bayview Ave, North York, ON M2L 1A2, Canada, Toronto, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Toronto Soccer Meetup","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-soccer-meetup/"},"performer":"Toronto Soccer Meetup"}]</script><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/4/6/d/highres_534669325.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/3/0/b/highres_531805355.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/7/6/d/highres_527105997.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/e